dsh-commandcode-quota README · Windows  ($env:DSH_HOME defaults to $env:USERPROFILE\.dsh)：$dsh = if ($env:DSH_HOME) { $env:DSH_HOME } else { "$env:USERPROFILE\.dsh" }
New-Item -ItemType Junction -Path "$dsh\profiles\web\node_modules\dsh-commandcode-quota" -Target "$PWD\dsh-commandcode-quota"
```

dsh-commandcode-quota README · Desktop client：**Declared in the profile (no loader row).** Add the package to `$dsh\profiles\desktop\package.json` — a `link:` dependency plus the name in the profile's bundle list — and let the package's own bundle patch register it:

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-commandcode-quota": "link:C:/path/to/dsh-commandcode-quota"
  },

Make sure the folder reaches `node_modules` as well — the profile resolves the `link:` through it:

dsh-commandcode-quota README · 桌面端：Electron 桌面端独占管理它自己的 profile：`dsh --profile desktop …` 会直接拒绝，报 `profile "desktop" is managed exclusively by the Electron application`。所以那边用不了 `dsh plugin`，只能手动挂。有两种挂法，**应用自己那份 profile 用的是第一种**：

**写进 profile（不需要 loader 行）**：把包加进 `$dsh\profiles\desktop\package.json` —— `link:` 依赖 + 名字放进 profile 的 bundle 列表，注册交给包自带的 bundle patch：

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-commandcode-quota": "link:C:/path/to/dsh-commandcode-quota"
  },

同时保证这个目录能通过 `node_modules` 解析到——profile 要靠它解析 `link:`：
